// ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
// Proof of Reserves — deploy environment (EXAMPLE)
//
// Copy this file to .env.preprod (or .env.preview) and fill in your values.
// NEVER commit the real .env.preprod / .env.preview — they are gitignored.
// ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# 64-character hex wallet seed. Generate one with:
#   npm run gen:seed
PROOF_OF_RESERVES_SEED=

# 64-character hex custodian secret. The on-chain custodianKey is the hash of
# this secret; only its holder can call attest(). Keep it offline and safe.
# Generate one with:
#   npm run gen:seed
PROOF_OF_RESERVES_CUSTODIAN_SECRET=
